            "notes": "## CORE\n- [Silver Spurs](item_8d812772-e37d-4af2-ade8-6a43d6e64a4c)\n- [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) \n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n\n## IMPORTANT TIP:\nEverytime you use your coach gun, you will reload 25% of your ammos with [Silver Spurs](item_8d812772-e37d-4af2-ade8-6a43d6e64a4c) that triggers [Reload Therapy](item_1d85105f-1ec7-4ec7-a56d-f273c09f4b3e). If you have [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34), you will reload 4 ammos that heal you of 40% of your life instantly.\n\n------------\n## STATS\nCoach Gun Self-heal \u2248 128hp",
